%rec: CborTagNamespace
%key: Namespace
%doc: Families of CBOR tags that share a name prefix. A tag whose IANA Semantics (or Reference) matches a
%doc: rule gets `Namespace: <name>`, and its Words must start with Prefix. A `label` group in the rule
%doc: captures the item's own name from the IANA text. See DEVELOPMENT.md, "CBOR tag namespaces".

Namespace: ur
Prefix: ur
Organization: Blockchain Commons
Description: Uniform Resources (ur:<type>): CBOR data as text for QR codes and wallets
Spec: https://github.com/BlockchainCommons/Research/blob/master/papers/bcr-2020-006-urtypes.md
Semantics Match: ^ur:(?P<label>[a-z0-9-]+)

Namespace: cose
Prefix: cose
Organization: IETF COSE working group
Description: CBOR Object Signing and Encryption structures
Spec: https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9052
Semantics Match: ^\[?COSE\s

Namespace: suit
Prefix: suit
Organization: IETF SUIT working group
Description: Software Updates for Internet of Things manifests and reports
Spec: https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-suit-manifest/
Semantics Match: ^SUIT_(?P<label>[A-Za-z0-9_]+)

Namespace: yang
Prefix: yang
Organization: IETF CORE working group
Description: YANG data encoded in CBOR (RFC 9254)
Spec: https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9254
Semantics Match: ^YANG\s

Namespace: platformv
Prefix: platformv
Organization: Wang Tongzhou
Description: PlatformV object model
Spec: https://github.com/arthurwangtz/platformv-cbor
Semantics Match: ^PlatformV_(?P<label>[A-Za-z0-9_]+)

Namespace: moat
Prefix: moat
Organization: Matthias Urlichs
Description: MoaT file and status markers
Spec: https://github.com/M-o-a-T/moat-util/
Semantics Match: ^MoaT\s
